  "titleRussian": "Причастия (обзор)",
  "description": "All 4 participle types compared",
  "descriptionRussian": "Сравнение всех четырёх типов причастий",
  "imageName": "square.grid.2x2",
  "intro": "Russian has 4 participle types in a 2x2 grid: ACTIVE vs PASSIVE, and PRESENT vs PAST. Active participles describe the doer (читающий = who reads). Passive participles describe the receiver (читаемый = being read). Present participles describe ongoing/general actions. Past participles describe completed actions. All replace 'который' clauses: человек, который читает → читающий человек. Choose based on: Is the noun doing or receiving? Is the action now or completed?",
  "rules": [
    "Active = noun does action: читающий (who reads), читавший (who was reading)",
    "Passive = noun receives action: читаемый (being read), прочитанный (that was read)",
    "Present = ongoing/habitual: читающий, читаемый (from imperfective verbs)",
    "Past = completed: читавший, прочитанный (impf or pf verbs)"
  ],
  "examples": [
    "Читающий студент — The reading student (active present: who reads)",
    "Читавший студент — The student who was reading (active past)",
    "Читаемая книга — The book being read (passive present)",
    "Прочитанная книга — The book that was read (passive past)"
  ],
